1
00:00:00,695 --> 00:00:02,325
(Sheldon:)Good for me.

2
00:00:04,949 --> 00:00:05,949
(Leonard:)Yeah, good for you.

3
00:00:07,034 --> 00:00:08,204
(Sheldon:)Oh, wait.

4
00:00:09,995 --> 00:00:12,415
Did you wanna talk about
what's bothering you?

5
00:00:13,666 --> 00:00:16,456
- I don't know. Maybe.
- Wow, I'm on fire tonight.

6
00:00:21,882 --> 00:00:23,552
Well, here's the thing.

7
00:00:23,718 --> 00:00:27,808
(Leonard:)Girls like Penny never end up with guys
who own time machines.

8
00:00:28,222 --> 00:00:29,392
(Sheldon:)I disagree.

9
00:00:29,557 --> 00:00:31,847
(Sheldon:)Your inability
to successfully woo Penny...

10
00:00:32,017 --> 00:00:35,227
(Sheldon:)...long predates your acquisition
of the time machine.

11
00:00:36,939 --> 00:00:39,979
(Sheldon:)That failure clearly stands on its own.

12
00:00:41,026 --> 00:00:44,116
- Thanks for pointing it out.
- In addition, your premise is flawed.

13
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:47,160
(Sheldon:)In the original film,
Rod Taylor got Yvette Mimieux...

14
00:00:47,324 --> 00:00:48,744
...with that time machine.

15
00:00:48,909 --> 00:00:51,619
(Sheldon:)In Back to the Future,
Marty McFly got to hook up...

16
00:00:51,787 --> 00:00:54,577
(Sheldon:)...with his extremely attractive
young mother.

17
00:00:57,126 --> 00:00:59,716
- Those are movies.
- Of course they're movies.

